        "comments": "-> [[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial]] general information about the serial port, serial port cable, etc.\n\nThe serial console connections are identical to the [[toh:zte:mf286d|ZTE MF286D]], which is shown below. **DO NOT** connect the 3.3V line unless your serial adapter needs it.\n\n{{:media:zte:mf286d:mf286d-serial-console.jpg?320|}}\n\nIt was observed, that CH340-based USB-UART converters output garbage during U-boot phase of system boot. At least CP2102 is known to work properly, which is widely available in this form:\n\n{{:media:zte:example-usb-ttl-adapter.jpeg?200|}}\n\n^ Serial connection parameters\\\\ for ZTE MF286R  | 115200, 8N1, 3.3V |\n",
